        <footnote id="F1">Pursuant to a Debt Conversion Agreement, dated November 6, 2026 (the &quot;Conversion Agreement&quot;), between Trident Digital Tech Holdings Ltd (the &quot;Issuer&quot;) and the Reporting Person, the Issuer agreed to convert US$3,000,000 of outstanding indebtedness owed to the Reporting Person under the demand grid promissory note, date October 31, 2026, into 4,615,384 Class B ordinary shares of the Issuer (the &quot;Class B Ordinary Shares&quot;), at a conversion price of US$0.65 per share. The Class B Ordinary Shares were issued to the Reporting Person in satisfaction and discharge of such indebtedness.</footnote>
